{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00675","headline":"郊庙歌辞 享太庙乐章 大定舞 · 李回","name":"郊庙歌辞 享太庙乐章 大定舞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"受天明命，敷佑下土。\n化时以俭，卫文以武。\n氛消夷夏，俗臻往古。\n亿万斯年，形于律吕。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李回","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00675.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00675","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}